<!doctype html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
<meta name="theme-color" content="#071222"><meta name="description" content="Katalog 1.500 spesifikasi fitur Git untuk Planetbintang OS MEDIA VM / REIC.">
<title>Katalog 1.500 Fitur Git · Planetbintang</title>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="./git-feature-catalog.css">
</head>
<body>
<header class="topbar"><a class="brand" href="./index.html" aria-label="Kembali ke Planetbintang"><span class="brand-mark">PB</span><span><b>PLANETBINTANG</b><small>OS MEDIA VM / REIC</small></span></a><div class="top-actions"><a href="./github-operations.html">GitHub Operations ↗</a><a href="https://github.com/planetbintang/.L/tree/io" rel="noopener">Repositori ↗</a><span class="branch">BASE: io</span></div></header>
<main class="shell">
<section class="hero"><p class="eyebrow">GIT PLATFORM · FEATURE REGISTRY</p><h1>Katalog <em>1.500</em> fitur</h1><p class="intro">Spesifikasi implementasi terstruktur untuk repositori, editor kode, Git, review, CI/CD, keamanan, deployment, dan desktop REIC. Katalog ini adalah pelacak spesifikasi—bukan klaim bahwa semua fitur telah aktif.</p><div class="stats"><div><strong id="totalCount">1.500</strong><span>Spesifikasi</span></div><div><strong id="moduleCount">30</strong><span>Modul</span></div><div><strong id="visibleCount">1.500</strong><span>Hasil cocok</span></div></div></section>
<section class="workspace" aria-label="Penjelajah fitur">
<aside class="filters"><label for="search">Cari fitur<input id="search" type="search" placeholder="Nama, ID, atau modul…"></label><label for="moduleFilter">Modul<select id="moduleFilter"><option value="">Semua modul</option></select></label><label for="statusFilter">Status spesifikasi<select id="statusFilter"><option value="">Semua status</option><option value="planned">Direncanakan</option><option value="in-review">Dalam tinjauan</option><option value="implemented">Diimplementasikan</option><option value="verified">Terverifikasi</option></select></label><div class="filter-note"><b>Catatan status</b><p>Status awal semua item adalah “Direncanakan”. Status hanya berubah setelah implementasi dan verifikasi nyata.</p></div><button id="exportBtn" class="secondary" type="button">Ekspor hasil JSON</button></aside>
<section class="results"><div class="results-head"><div><p class="eyebrow">FEATURE REGISTRY</p><h2>Daftar fitur</h2></div><span id="resultSummary">Memuat katalog…</span></div><div id="featureList" class="feature-list" aria-live="polite"></div><nav class="pager" aria-label="Navigasi halaman"><button id="prevPage" type="button">Sebelumnya</button><span id="pageInfo">Halaman 1</span><button id="nextPage" type="button">Berikutnya</button></nav></section>
<aside class="detail" aria-label="Detail fitur"><div id="detailContent" class="detail-empty"><span class="detail-icon">⌘</span><h2>Pilih fitur</h2><p>Pilih salah satu dari 1.500 spesifikasi untuk melihat lima poin detail dan prompt implementasinya.</p></div></aside>
</section>
<footer><span>Planetbintang · Feature Registry</span><span>Static catalog · no secret credentials stored</span><a href="./index.html">Kembali ke sistem utama</a></footer>
</main>
<script src="./git-feature-catalog.js" defer></script>
</body></html>